<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1522] Cache entry listener is executed on a joining node</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1522</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Scenario is the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start first node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Register cache entry listener. Its configuration is added to cache configuration (required by JCache).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start second node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;As a result entry listener configuration is serialized as a part of cache configuration, which is wrong. Moreover, it&apos;s executed on this new node.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Need to make listener configurations transient.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
